I am in the living room.
My bags lie on the floor.
I open a bag.
My laptop is in it.
I take the laptop out.
There is a small desk in the room.
I place the laptop on that desk.
Now the laptop sits on the desk.
I take the next bag.
My favorite books are in it.
There is a chair near the desk.
There is a small shelf near the chair.
I place those books on the shelf.
The books now sit neatly on the shelf.
My workspace is now ready.
I sit in my new chair.
